    _atom_type_scat_source
    Zn Zn -1.612  .678 'International Tables for Crystallography (Vol. IV)'
    V V  .035 2.110 'International Tables for Crystallography (Vol. IV)'
    O O  .047  .032 'International Tables for Crystallography (Vol. IV)'
    H H  .000  .000 'International Tables for Crystallography (Vol. IV)'

